  "claimBoundary": "text-free oracle-answer feasibility and pricing sensitivity for three finite multiway semantic questions over the frozen 14-contract universe; not human/UI burden evidence, raw-language understanding, model/deployed answer reliability, open-world discovery outside the universe, protected evidence, registration, authority, action, or execution"
